[{:db/id "q-278476/field-1/99e82454801632a516efd7568e919c35ae432660af63a36aebbf4a1976536d21" :answer/id #uuid "0b53e384-6f12-5953-be2a-b32dbf3bfe9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+1)^2}{16}+(y+3)^2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278476/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "b1609a5d-58ad-56cf-9408-b4744ef31d4f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278476/field-1/99e82454801632a516efd7568e919c35ae432660af63a36aebbf4a1976536d21" :answer-field/choices ["q-278476/field-1/99e82454801632a516efd7568e919c35ae432660af63a36aebbf4a1976536d21"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278476" :question/id #uuid "8d0ac665-608e-5cb2-bf77-2d2a2418aeac" :question/math-academy-id "q-278476" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13958359/assets/8af601d0056c7ec678d6b21ba689413ec4b6f7107ab971394cf11316f5ec6f47.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the ellipse given above?\n\n{{field-1}}$=1$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the general equation of an ellipse centered at $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nHere, the ellipse is centered at $(-1,-3),$ the horizontal radius has length $a=4,$ and the vertical radius has length $b=1.$ Therefore, the equation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-(-1))^{2}}{{4}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-(-3))^{2}}{{1}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x+1)^{2}}{16}+(y+3)^{2} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-278476/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "19d1448c-d5fd-5615-b657-ff4d66867834"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278476"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-278480/field-1/9ed88ddaa7d618c65ed0c59d07f36f3d697121a2ca8c40812f296e3f7f8479a5" :answer/id #uuid "6fdb1df1-d8af-5de3-8327-60e2ca39017e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+3)^2}{16}+\\frac{y^2}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278480/field-1/10361ddbe2e761472bcd08b2c82fb4f7eaceeb7f608e9f5450e2b94e1ea5ddf3" :answer/id #uuid "7bd084c2-a946-5ae9-9b58-a760dd2f274f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-3)^2}{16}+\\frac{y^2}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-278480/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "17e39029-797b-5735-bfd0-ea075dc011e4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-278480/field-1/9ed88ddaa7d618c65ed0c59d07f36f3d697121a2ca8c40812f296e3f7f8479a5" :answer-field/choices ["q-278480/field-1/9ed88ddaa7d618c65ed0c59d07f36f3d697121a2ca8c40812f296e3f7f8479a5" "q-278480/field-1/10361ddbe2e761472bcd08b2c82fb4f7eaceeb7f608e9f5450e2b94e1ea5ddf3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-278480" :question/id #uuid "45384558-0ec9-5637-a95a-563522a4d678" :question/math-academy-id "q-278480" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13958359/assets/c5672a0655ffd9ab3e098250e70f5bb782d14fd53c327ff7d14a1c0d798d25c4.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the ellipse given above?\n\n{{field-1}}$=1$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the general equation of an ellipse centered at $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nHere, the ellipse is centered at $(-3,0),$ the horizontal radius has length $a=4,$ and the vertical radius has length $b=2.$ Therefore, the equation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-(-3))^{2}}{{4}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-0)^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-278480/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "19d1448c-d5fd-5615-b657-ff4d66867834"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-278480"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115286/selection/50116a6027022950501a6e956c5e21122f23763f046c4556f920f4999ba391a2" :answer/id #uuid "9f316800-04f0-5737-8506-96e5ac596714" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{(y+3)^{2}}{4}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115286/selection/f86be057341020ffa7c998270fee1aa839ead5dd1309263338b2c81c1619d285" :answer/id #uuid "0baf5261-e94f-5a54-b879-c1d8cf85b463" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+4)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(y-3)^{2}}{4}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115286/selection/f5f7a831b28a7f69ab9b392cb90c42ab477ae157012b7f2276bfce174eb5259f" :answer/id #uuid "0dc4c89d-07de-5ed8-a1db-6ab1171a43cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-3)^{2}}{16}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115286/selection/0ce745d85c6222a69df0449a8c90b364d3d89cfc29a93f308b0639d8a4187afc" :answer/id #uuid "646c5754-af2a-5105-9ca0-45b6d897fa64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+4)^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y-3)^{2}}{4}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115286/selection/5efbff53e3e18aa1b7e258030a95439cd13a32c33914939ad9a0868da251cdf1" :answer/id #uuid "8843e2a2-e41a-584a-9188-05b9f27fd30a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+4)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y+3)^{2}}{2}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115286/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e50d38e0-2af9-5e80-877d-f0e939caec99" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-115286/selection/f86be057341020ffa7c998270fee1aa839ead5dd1309263338b2c81c1619d285" :answer-field/choices ["q-115286/selection/50116a6027022950501a6e956c5e21122f23763f046c4556f9